[ti:Don't Drop It!]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.78]Lesson 39 | 第39课
[00:03.11]Don't drop it! | 别摔了!
[00:06.28]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.44]Where does Sam put the vase in the end? | 最后萨姆把花瓶放在哪里了?
[00:18.55]What are you going to do with that vase, Penny? | 彭尼,你打算用那个花瓶做什么?
[00:24.02]I'm going to put it on this table, Sam. | 我打算把它放在这张桌子上,萨姆。
[00:29.15]Don't do that. | 别那样做。
[00:31.31]Give it to me. | 把它给我。
[00:33.63]What are you going to do with it? | 你打算用它做什么?
[00:37.39]I'm going to put it here, in front of the window. | 我打算把它放在这里,窗户前面。
[00:43.03]Be careful! Don't drop it! | 小心!别摔了!
[00:47.32]Don't put it there, Sam. | 别把它放在那儿,萨姆。
[00:50.31]Put it here, on this shelf. | 放在这里,这个架子上。
[00:54.70]There we are! | 你看,放好了!
[00:56.74]It's a lovely vase. | 这是一个漂亮的花瓶。
[00:59.47]Those flowers are lovely, too. | 那些花也很漂亮。